@startuml F3.5-D04-rejeitar-formativa
title F3.5-D04 — Rejeitar formativa com parecer
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "FormativeController" as Ctrl
participant "RejectFormativeUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Indeferir com parecer
note right of WebApp
  parecer < 20 chars
  → bloqueio client (sem HTTP)
end note
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /formativas/{id}/indeferir
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE INDEFERIDA\n+ event_log\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: formativa INDEFERIDA

@enduml
